    "detailed_description": "Tilesweeper is a well-known game Minesweeper, but with stunning graphics.<br />\r\nThe game provides various themes for the levels.<br />\r\nCurrently in the game available one theme - Castle, later new themes will be available as DLC.<br />\r\nIn each theme there are two types of levels - classical and arcade.<br />\r\nClassic levels are the usual levels of the classic Minesweeper: 9x9, 16x16 and 30x16, but in the design of the chosen theme.<br />\r\nArcade levels are levels of non-standard shapes and sizes.",
